Linux Wi-Fi Userspace Ports
===========================

This directory stages the userspace pieces that will eventually talk to the
NuttX-side nl80211/cfg80211/mac80211 port in nuttx/wireless/ieee80211.

Imported source drops:

  libnl-3.2.25
  wpa_supplicant-2.11
  hostapd-2.11

NuttX-specific public port headers live under:

  common/include

Keep common app-side portability definitions there instead of editing upstream
headers.  The nl80211 UAPI should come from the NuttX-side imported kernel UAPI
include path so userspace and kernel-side ports do not drift.
